{"_v":1,"id":"evita-2012","cs":63,"rc":14,"bd":{"positive":3,"mixed":7,"negative":4},"rv":[{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"http://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/evita-revived-on-broadway-1.3643191","q":"Fierce new Eva Perón seduces again."},{"cn":"Steven Suskin","o":"Variety","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.variety.com/review/VE1117947355?refCatId=33","d":"2012-04-05","q":"Director Michael Grandage scores with a dynamic new 'Evita,' graced by an impressive performance from Argentinean actress Elena Roger"},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/evita-theater-review-ricky-martin-308779/","d":"2012-04-05","q":"But this is Eva’s show, and Roger holds it firmly in her tenacious grip."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"http://www.huffingtonpost.com/2012/04/05/evita-review-ricky-martin_n_1407387.html","d":"2012-04-05","q":"And yet there's something distancing about this \"Evita.\""},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/entertainment/theater_dance/evita-review-ricky-martin-stars-in-adequate-revival/2012/04/06/gIQAhkMz0S_story.html","d":"2012-04-06","q":"The revival of Andrew Lloyd Webber and Tim Rice's musical biography of Eva Perón is adequate but not inspired, despite the considerable charisma of its leads."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"TheaterMania","s":57,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theatermania.com/news/review-evita_54031/","d":"2012-04-05","q":"Roger is often flat and shrill and has trouble enunciating some of the words (due in part to her actual Argentine accent)."},{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"Vulture","s":48,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2012/04/theater-review-throwing-up-my-hands-at-evita.html","d":"2012-04-06","q":"Part of the blame goes to the show itself, so stuffed with luscious pop motifs, so strangely devoid of emotion."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2012/04/06/theater/reviews/evita-starring-elena-roger-at-the-marquis-theater.html","d":"2012-04-05","q":"This musical combination of history pageant and requiem Mass feels about as warmblooded as a gilded mummy."},{"cn":"Michael Musto","o":"Village Voice","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://blogs.villagevoice.com/dailymusto/2012/04/evita_returns_m.php","q":"So while Broadway's original Evita was more innovative and starry, this one has a bracing intimacy and vigor that makes you feel the truth is, she never left you."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":69,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/Evita.html","d":"2012-04-06","q":"Elena Roger brings a fierce intensity to the role that's both thrilling and exhausting to watch, but her vocals, while powerful, sometimes lack the soaring beauty the score demands."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":69,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/theater/2012/04/06/evita-broadway-review/53939442/","d":"2012-04-06","q":"Ricky Martin brings star wattage and a passionate, if not always polished, performance to the role of Che"},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/arts_entertainment/theater/146394175__Evita_s__lack_of_starpower_a_crying_shame.html?page=all","q":"But the revival, the first on Broadway since the show debuted in 1979, is a sadly missed opportunity."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/evita/","d":"2012-04-23","q":"As a study of the falseness of character, and the narcissism of benevolence, it’s a transfixing study, one which endears us to a character we’re loath to love."},{"cn":"Steven Suskin","o":"Stage and Cinema","s":46,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://stageandcinema.com/2012/04/20/evita-marquis-theatre/","d":"2012-04-23","q":"Today the story of an ambitious woman using her sexuality to get ahead seems trite and quaint."}],"au":{"score":83,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":74,"c":159,"sr":3.7},"ss":{"s":88,"c":252}}},"ta":"210 W 46th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2012-03-12","ca":[{"n":"Michael Cerveris","r":"Perón"},{"n":"Ricky Martin","r":"Che"},{"n":"Elena Roger","r":"Eva Perón"},{"n":"Christina DeCicco","r":"Eva Perón"},{"n":"Rachel Potter","r":"Mistress"},{"n":"Max von Essen","r":"Magaldi"},{"n":"Ashley Amber","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"George Lee Andrews","r":"Priest"},{"n":"Eric L. Christian","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Kristine Covillo","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Colin Cunliffe","r":"Eva's Family"},{"n":"Margot de la Barre","r":"Nurse"},{"n":"Bradley Dean","r":"Cabinet Member"},{"n":"Rebecca Eichenberger","r":"Eva's Family"},{"n":"Melanie Field","r":"Nurse"},{"n":"Maya Jade Frank","r":"Child"},{"n":"Constantine Germanacos","r":"General"},{"n":"Laurel Harris","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Bahiyah Hibah","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Nick Kenkel","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Brad Little","r":"Italian Admiral"},{"n":"Erica Mansfield","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Emily Mechler","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Isabela Moner","r":"Child"},{"n":"Sydney Morton","r":"Eva's Family"},{"n":"Jessica Lea Patty","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Aleks Pevec","r":"Eva's Lover"},{"n":"Rachel Potter","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Kristie Dale Sanders","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Timothy Shew","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Johnny Stellard","r":"Eva's Lover"},{"n":"Alex Michael Stoll","r":"Eva's Lover"},{"n":"Daniel Torres","r":"General"}]}